{
  "id": "ag-sequences",
  "chapterNumber": "7",
  "title": {
    "en": "Sequences &amp; Series",
    "ar": null
  },
  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "A sequence is an ordered list of numbers following a rule; a series is their sum. Two patterns dominate: adding a constant (arithmetic) and multiplying by a constant (geometric).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Definition 7.1 — Arithmetic sequence",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Each term adds a common difference \\( d \\): \\( a_n=a_1+(n-1)d \\). The sum of the first \\( n \\) terms is</p>\\[ S_n=\\frac{n}{2}\\big(a_1+a_n\\big). \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Definition 7.2 — Geometric sequence",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Each term multiplies by a common ratio \\( r \\): \\( a_n=a_1\\,r^{\\,n-1} \\). The first \\( n \\) terms sum to \\( S_n=a_1\\dfrac{1-r^{n}}{1-r} \\), and when \\( |r|&lt;1 \\) the infinite sum converges:</p>\\[ S_\\infty=\\frac{a_1}{1-r}. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Arithmetic — term",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( a_n=a_1+(n-1)d \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Arithmetic — sum",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( S_n=\\dfrac{n}{2}(a_1+a_n) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Geometric — term",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( a_n=a_1\\cdot r^{n-1} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Geometric — sum",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( S_n=a_1\\cdot\\dfrac{1-r^n}{1-r} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 7.A — Arithmetic sum",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the sum of the first \\( 20 \\) terms of \\( 3,7,11,\\dots \\)</p><p>Here \\( a_1=3,\\ d=4 \\), so \\( a_{20}=3+19(4)=79 \\). Then</p>\\[ S_{20}=\\frac{20}{2}\\big(3+79\\big)=10\\cdot 82=820. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 7.B — Infinite geometric sum",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Evaluate \\( 8+4+2+1+\\cdots \\)</p><p>With \\( a_1=8 \\) and \\( r=\\tfrac12 \\) (and \\( |r|&lt;1 \\)):</p>\\[ S_\\infty=\\frac{8}{1-\\tfrac12}=16. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
